completed_at: "2026-08-13T14:39:50.473Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "Every gate declaring the ci trigger is evaluated on pull requests; A check proves the set of gates wired into the pull-request workflow equals the set declaring the ci trigger, so the two lists cannot drift apart silently; record-integrity failing blocks a merge rather than a nightly run"
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: high
confidence: 97
resolution: All three ci-triggered assurance gates now run on pull requests; the append-only history assertion is evaluated before merge instead of only nightly.
expected_result: "A changeset that violates history-append-only, graph composition, or tracker context quality fails its own pull request."
actual_result: "Only tracker-context-quality was wired to pull requests; graph-composition and record-integrity reached a runner only via pnpm quality:static in nightly.yml and release.yml, so both were evaluated only after the change had merged."
